WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:03.719
The late prodigy and his protégé have reunited
- but why?

00:00:03.719 --> 00:00:07.920
Mere days after it was reported that Disney
and Sony failed to reach an agreement to establish

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.500
new terms of the deal that allows Spider-Man
to be a part of the Marvel Cinematic Universe,

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.720
Spider-Man himself paid a visit to one of
the most beloved Marvel actors out there.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:18.760
Tom Holland, the man at the center of the
Disney-Sony debacle, and Iron Man star Robert

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:23.560
Downey Jr. were hanging out together on August
22nd - just two days after the world learned

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:27.980
that Spider-Man would be leaving the MCU to
remain sole property of Sony Pictures.

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:32.220
Holland took to Instagram to share a series
of snaps of himself and Downey Jr. together.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:35.890
Shared in a carousel post to Holland's 30
million followers on the platform, three of

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:38.240
the four photos show the two men on a hike.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:42.300
They smile at the camera in one shot, pull
some silly faces in another, and flex their

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.920
muscles and scowl in the third.

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:47.610
The final picture in the collection is perhaps
the funniest of all: it shows Holland and

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:51.840
Downey Jr. in a house playing with Spider-Man
and Iron Man action figures.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.170
Holland's seen holding one of the armored
Avenger, while Downey Jr. is flashing a wide

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:58.190
grin at the camera and holding a Spider-Man
toy up to his face.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:02.579
To top it all off, Holland captioned the photo
set with, "We did it, Mr. Stark!," which sure

00:01:02.579 --> 00:01:03.579
sounds familiar.

00:01:03.579 --> 00:01:04.579
"We won.

00:01:04.579 --> 00:01:06.590
You did it, sir.

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:08.139
You did it.”

00:01:08.139 --> 00:01:11.439
That's an innocent enough caption - it's just
Holland's witty way of saying that he and

00:01:11.439 --> 00:01:15.250
Downey Jr. completed what was probably a grueling
hike in the summer heat.

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:19.319
And these are innocent enough photos - they
show two actors who have become friends off-screen

00:01:19.319 --> 00:01:23.549
spending a day in sunny California, getting
some fresh air, and letting loose a little.

00:01:23.549 --> 00:01:27.249
However, given recent events, some fans are
convinced that these photos and Holland's

00:01:27.249 --> 00:01:31.630
caption means that the two actors may have
received some good news about Spidey's status

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:32.740
in the MCU.

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:36.270
The comments section of Holland's post are
filled with speculative statements - like

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:40.479
the idea that Marvel Studios president Kevin
Feige rang up Holland, told him Disney and

00:01:40.479 --> 00:01:44.579
Sony went back to the negotiating table and
agreed to let Spider-Man back into Marvel's

00:01:44.579 --> 00:01:47.680
movie world, and had him meet up with Downey
Jr. to celebrate.

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:51.509
Others seem to believe that Holland and Downey
Jr. may have had a sit-down discussion with

00:01:51.509 --> 00:01:56.299
Disney and/or Sony executives about the Spider-Man
madness, and their after-hike selfies were

00:01:56.299 --> 00:01:58.570
meant to tease that the meeting yielded great
results.

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:02.819
Now, we don't know the intimate details of
Holland and Downey Jr.'s lives, but it's difficult

00:02:02.819 --> 00:02:06.229
to believe that the real reason why the two
are hanging out right now has much to do with

00:02:06.229 --> 00:02:08.670
Spider-Man's recent departure from the MCU.

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:12.430
The interesting thing here, though, is why
Holland and Downey Jr. were in the same place.

00:02:12.430 --> 00:02:15.870
Holland recently said on Instagram that he
was going "back to work" after apparently

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:19.769
taking some time off - and since Hollywood
is the epicenter of the entertainment industry,

00:02:19.769 --> 00:02:23.530
it makes sense that, for Holland, going back
to work means heading to California.

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:26.530
Surely Holland and Downey Jr. would make time
to hang out when the youngster touched down

00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:30.319
in Tinseltown no matter what, considering
they have a genuine friendship, but the two

00:02:30.319 --> 00:02:34.099
are actually working on a project together:
Universal Pictures' Dolittle.

00:02:34.099 --> 00:02:38.959
Based on Hugh Lofting's 1922 book The Voyages
of Doctor Dolittle, the film features Downey

00:02:38.959 --> 00:02:42.930
Jr. as Dr. John Dolittle and Holland as the
voice of a dog named Jip.

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:46.939
Since the flick is set for release in January
2020, it stands to reason that the cast is

00:02:46.939 --> 00:02:51.230
in California finishing up filming so Dolittle
can enter post-production in time for its

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:52.310
theatrical launch.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:56.319
So, there you have it: Holland and Downey
Jr. are probably spending time together because

00:02:56.319 --> 00:03:00.329
they're wrapped up Dolittle, not because
they executed a secret plan to storm the offices

00:03:00.329 --> 00:03:04.469
of Sony Pictures and demand that the studio
squash its beef with Disney and Marvel so

00:03:04.469 --> 00:03:06.489
Spider-Man can stick around the MCU.

00:03:06.489 --> 00:03:10.189
Though the timing makes it seem like there's
way more at play, and Holland's cheeky caption

00:03:10.189 --> 00:03:14.739
only adds more fuel to the fires of speculation,
the Great Holland-Downey Jr. Hang Out Sesh

00:03:14.739 --> 00:03:17.769
of 2019 is likely all down to Dolittle.

00:03:17.769 --> 00:03:21.350
And if it isn't, well, Marvel fans have
a big storm coming.

